    "detailed_description": "Are you someone who is a bit tired of endlessly managing resources in a city-building game, but still enjoy seeing your beautiful cities grow? We too!<br><br>We would like to present you with a game of relaxing atmosphere, and vibrant warmth of charming landscapes. By the end of the game you will expand your settlements from humble villages to sprawling cities. All this without tedious resource management and unnecessary stress!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/dfda16604497b994e4ccb83d02fd1704.poster.avif?t=1722704603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/dfda16604497b994e4ccb83d02fd1704.webm?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/dfda16604497b994e4ccb83d02fd1704.mp4?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are many playstyles available, from methodically planning your turns; to just following along with the game and placing the buildings wherever the most resources are; to completely ignoring the game rules and releasing your inner creative, building the most picturesque landscape. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/9a18c0e814749d51451ba10a7fe19096.poster.avif?t=1722704603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/9a18c0e814749d51451ba10a7fe19096.webm?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/9a18c0e814749d51451ba10a7fe19096.mp4?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We are a small team and would be thrilled if you gave us a chance. Enjoy your stay and see you in the Land of Honey and Wine!",
    "about_the_game": "Are you someone who is a bit tired of endlessly managing resources in a city-building game, but still enjoy seeing your beautiful cities grow? We too!<br><br>We would like to present you with a game of relaxing atmosphere, and vibrant warmth of charming landscapes. By the end of the game you will expand your settlements from humble villages to sprawling cities. All this without tedious resource management and unnecessary stress!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/dfda16604497b994e4ccb83d02fd1704.poster.avif?t=1722704603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/dfda16604497b994e4ccb83d02fd1704.webm?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/dfda16604497b994e4ccb83d02fd1704.mp4?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are many playstyles available, from methodically planning your turns; to just following along with the game and placing the buildings wherever the most resources are; to completely ignoring the game rules and releasing your inner creative, building the most picturesque landscape. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/9a18c0e814749d51451ba10a7fe19096.poster.avif?t=1722704603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/9a18c0e814749d51451ba10a7fe19096.webm?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2426290/extras/9a18c0e814749d51451ba10a7fe19096.mp4?t=1722704603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We are a small team and would be thrilled if you gave us a chance. Enjoy your stay and see you in the Land of Honey and Wine!",
